{"diagnosis": "Fetch makes no progress: max_addr stays 0x00000000 vs expected sequential fetch through 256 NOP words, ending in FAIL 0xdead and 'no progress' TRAP after 2009 cycles. Both reg_pc and reg_next_pc hold current_pc so the fetch address never advances. Root cause is lines 1526-1527 where reg_next_pc <= current_pc lacks the +4 increment, stalling PC at reset.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -1526,2 +1526,2 @@
 				reg_pc <= current_pc;
-				reg_next_pc <= current_pc;
+				reg_next_pc <= current_pc + 4;", "expected": "tohost PASS (not FAIL 0xdead) with fetch progress max_addr advancing beyond 0x0 and no 'no progress' TRAP"}

